     1	"""Post-analysis extract for the paper (not part of the stamped manifest): R3's audit counts and full audit allocation per
     2	winner set, rate and market, from exactly the diagnostics records the committed collector (rep_collect.collect) accepts
     3	for expectation 5, the list of cells whose continued search produced the primary winner, the collector's status fields,
     4	and the sha256 of the run's analysis, draw and manifest, so that replication_paper.py can refuse a stale extract.
     5	
     6	Exactness: the collector is run unchanged. Two of its module functions are wrapped for the duration of the call only:
     7	_audit_of returns the same (audited, served) tuple with the allocation attached, and select_winner records which
     8	continuation record produced which winner kind. Nothing the collector decides changes.
     9	
    10	Usage: replication_extract.py --out <followup3-rep dir> --manifest <manifest> --draw <draw.json> --write <json>"""
    11	import argparse
    12	import hashlib
    13	import json
